«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TriAsymCDFc
  @  Upper tail at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "TriAsymCDFc: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + xpv 0 + Xv 0 + → Xmin Xmax xp X « '1-(IFTE(X≤Xmin;0;IFTE(X≤xp;((X-Xmin)^2)/((Xmax-Xmin)*(xp-Xmin));IFTE(X≤Xmax;1-((Xmax-X)^2)/((Xmax-Xmin)*(Xmax-xp));1))))' →Num Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv 4 →List Drop » »
»
